@CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5122

### Health check (si existe)
GET {{CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Chat síncrono (requiere Auth Service corriendo + token)
POST {{CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "message": "hola, ¿qué puedes hacer?"
}

### Chat streaming SSE (requiere Auth Service corriendo + token)
POST {{CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "message": "cuéntame un chiste"
}

### Chat con thread_id específico (multi-turn)
POST {{CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "message": "continúa con lo que decíamos",
  "threadId": "thread-123"
}

### Chat sin token (debe retornar 401)
POST {{CoppAddresd.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "hola"
}
